WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,180
I can't hold on if you wait any longer

2
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:10,980
As long as I'm in a mess

3
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:12,970
It's her ration

4
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,220
Ask you one last time

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,950
Where did the incident between you and Shen Nian happen, Brother Mo?

6
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:24,820
I've said it many times

7
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,400
In Silver Bay

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,990
There was no trace of fish killing at all in Yinshawan that day. In addition,

9
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:34,990
You said the engine of the lifeboat broke down and you rowed it back.

10
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:37,390
But the lifeboat's fuel capacity was reduced by two-thirds.

11
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:42,080
If you lie again, Brother Mo

12
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,650
I think I hurt my sister

13
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,850
I have been attracted by my parents since I was a child

14
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:50,450
How could I hurt their own daughter if I could?

15
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:52,050
I would rather die for my sister

16
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:59,930
Pearl was the only one who came back alive

17
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,840
She already blames herself enough

18
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:06,100
It’s so hard not to

19
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,220
I'm asking for the truth

20
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:11,020
You talk to me about self-blame

21
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,800
Shen Nian is your biological sister
